ut also highly  developed muscle fibers are present  there while the oceanic Clans have a  bigger set of arms which are widened in  the lower part via extended cartilage  and webbing-like connections between  fingers the same could be said about the  legs and the lower leg part being wider  and having a similar webbing and the  extension of the cartilage which makes  them look like flippers  in which both adaptations help the navi  swim faster and become more hydronomic  the biggest difference here is seen in  the tail the metcalina's tail is broader  and looks like a paddle at the end and  this allows for steering as well as  propulsion underwater  these navies both of them have humanoid  bodies with feline traits including flat  split noses huge round eyes pointed ears  and a long prehensile tail utilized for  grabbing and balancing while both the  two clans are similar in height which  varies from 2.5 to 3.9 meters or 8.2 to  12.7 feet tall the oceanic Clans have a  bulkier body the metcalina also have a  lighter shade of skin color being more  turquoise rather than the darker blue  shade of the umatikaya the skin of the  ocean Clan Navi also have different wave  like patterns of Stripes which kind of  resembles the wave the breaking waves of  the water as compared to the tiger  stripes of the forest Clans which are  adaptations for camouflage in their  respective environments and also these  wave-like patterns are complemented with  tattoo markings overall the Met kaina  appear to be bigger and bulkier than the  other  there are also quite a few more  physiological differences between the  two the metcaina for instance have  smaller ears than the omatikaya which is  helpful to reduce the chance of water  getting inside them they also have  flattenosis for the same reason  there's still air breathers though so  they've adapted to being able to hold  their breath for long periods of time  and therefore the lung size and capacity  is significantly larger than the  omatikaya they have nictating membranes  kind of like crocodiles and owls to  protect their eyes when they are  underwater they enter the water in high  speed and also their eyes are wider  bigger and more farther apart while the  Forest Clans have sharper eye complex  which is needed in the forest biomes to  focus on prey and the highly dense  serrated jungle environment as they are  also Apex species in their own  respective environments  so those are the anatomical and  physiological differences between the  two clans the metraina and the umatikaya  but then there is another main  difference between these two Clans and  these are the symbiotic species of  animals that they born with  there are three main animals for each  gland geomaticaya's basic state is a  dire horse and can be connected via the  neural pathway with any Navi or even  avatars and this is the same thing with  the ilu the long neck plesiosaur like  marine animal of the metcaina going a  step further is the bond between the  specific Navi individuals and their own  Wall Streets which are the flying  Banshees for the forest Clans while it  is the skim wing for the oceanic Clans  then there is level three the ultimate  symbiosis the bond between the forests  Navi and the turak are the great  leonopteryx becoming torrett makto and  the bond between the metcaina individual  and a tulkin another sentient species of  Pandora and becoming sole companions is  the ultimate level for the metcaina so  those are the differences between the  met kaina and the omatikaya I hope you  have enjoyed watching this video do hit  the like button for support and  subscribe but most of all smash that  Bell icon for regular updates on new  videos here on this channel till the  next one take care fam

